/*
:name: hotmux_unique_1
:type: lec
:lec_top: dec
:set: compile.cprop.engine=aegraph
*/
// HEADER-ONLY variant: hotmux_unique.prp compiled by the acyclic e-graph engine
// (pass.aegraph) against the classic compile of the base. `unique if` lowers to
// ONE exclusive Hotmux whose proven code is part of the engine's hash-cons key,
// so an exclusive Hotmux is shared only with an identical, equally proven twin
// and a non-exclusive one stays a skeleton leaf (its overlap obligation must
// survive). The pair must still prove equal.
